E":"窗边有点儿冷，要不要再穿一件？"}},"HSK3-C03-R-V1":{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"山","B":"电","C":"太阳","D":"终于","E":"收到","F":"迟到"}},"HSK3-C03-R-V2":{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"电梯","B":"锻炼","C":"耳机","D":"检票","E":"打算","F":"如果"}},"HSK3-C03-R-T57":{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-T57","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"以前我和姐姐出去玩，总是在大家都去的地方拍照。上个星期我们到公园时，门口的人特别多，她就带我往里走。走了十几分钟，我们发现了一棵很大的树，旁边几乎没有人。我们在那里拍了不少照片，我最满意的是她站在树下的那张。"},"HSK3-C03-R-T59":{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-T59","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"小安计划下午三点到学校参加活动。他原来准备坐公共汽车，出门才发现那条路上车太多。他改坐地铁，提前二十分钟到了。进门的时候，他才想起答应帮同学带耳机。幸好同学已经借到了一副，他就直接去找老师了。"}},"examples":{"EM":{"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"我还在路上，你能到楼下等我吗？","answer":"B"},"EV1":{"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"上班以前能爬到（　）上看看吗？","answer":"A"},"EV2":{"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：走了那么久，你还要上楼吗？／乙：要，坐（　）很快就能到。","answer":"A"},"E3":{"passage":"我把照片发给爸爸。他很喜欢，说这张是在学校拍的。我告诉他，那是在公园里拍的。","question":"照片是在哪儿拍的？","options":{"A":"学校","B":"公园","C":"家里"},"answer":"B"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-31","number":31,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"哪张照片你觉得照得最好？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-32","number":32,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"手机快没电了，怎么办？","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-33","number":33,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"这个路口现在能过去吗？","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-34","number":34,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"你能把那张照片发给我吗？","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-35","number":35,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M1","prompt":"那趟高铁开始检票了吗？","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-36","number":36,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M2","prompt":"我下车时忘在座位上了。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-37","number":37,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M2","prompt":"不用了，我带了大衣，这就穿上。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-38","number":38,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M2","prompt":"去有大树的那个公园吧。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-39","number":39,"lesson":5,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M2","prompt":"因为想多锻炼，最近总坐着不动。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-40","number":40,"lesson":6,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-M2","prompt":"我下了车才发现，自己坐过了一站。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-41","number":41,"lesson":5,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"昨天等了一天，今天（　）有好消息了。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-42","number":42,"lesson":5,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"你（　）我的邮件了吗？我刚刚发的。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-43","number":43,"lesson":5,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"昨天晚上忘了给手机充（　）。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-44","number":44,"lesson":5,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"一看到（　）出来了，孩子们就跑到院子里去玩。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-45","number":45,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V1","prompt":"我们早点儿出门，开会可不能（　）。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-46","number":46,"lesson":5,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：你为什么每天走路回家？／乙：我想多（　）一下。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-47","number":47,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：还要多久才开始（　）？／乙：还有十分钟，先把车票准备好吧。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-48","number":48,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这次放假你（　）去哪儿？／乙：我想去看看上大学的姐姐。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-49","number":49,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：我戴上（　）了，你现在说话我能听见。／乙：好，我现在开始读。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-50","number":50,"lesson":6,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-V2","prompt":"甲：今天还去海边吗？／乙：（　）下雨，咱们就改天再去。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-51","number":51,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"去年我想学拍照，却不知道从哪里开始。朋友建议我每天拍一样东西，不用买新相机。我就先用手机试了试。","question":"他起初用什么拍照？","options":{"A":"旧相机","B":"手机","C":"新相机"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-52","number":52,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"这座楼有两个电梯。左边那个今天不能用，右边那个只到五楼。去六楼的人可以先到五楼，再走一层楼梯。","question":"去六楼可以怎么办？","options":{"A":"坐左边的电梯直达","B":"从楼外下去","C":"从五楼走上一层"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-53","number":53,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"昨晚雨下得很大，早上山路还有水。我们没有往山上走，就在山下拍了几张照片，等天气好了再去爬山。","question":"他们这次在哪里拍照？","options":{"A":"山下","B":"家里","C":"山上"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-54","number":54,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我把车票改到下午，妹妹还按原来的时间坐十点那趟车。她会先到宾馆，我下车以后再去找她。","question":"谁先到宾馆？","options":{"A":"妹妹","B":"司机","C":"我"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-55","number":55,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"以前大家一起跑，我总在最后。现在我每周自己去两三次，能跟上大部分人了。我觉得再练一段时间就会更好。","question":"他现在跑步怎么样？","options":{"A":"已经是最快的了","B":"比以前进步了","C":"还是总跑最后"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-56","number":56,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"你到车站后先别出大门。往右边走，走到买票的地方就给我打电话。我在那里等你，咱们一起去检票。","question":"他在哪里等？","options":{"A":"买票的地方","B":"检票口","C":"车站大门外"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-57","number":57,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-T57","question":"他们为什么没在公园门口拍照？","options":{"A":"没有带相机","B":"天已经黑了","C":"人太多"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-58","number":58,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-T57","question":"他最满意的是哪张？","options":{"A":"在门口拍的","B":"姐姐站在树下的","C":"上次拍的"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-59","number":59,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-T59","question":"小安最后坐什么去学校？","options":{"A":"出租车","B":"公共汽车","C":"地铁"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-R-60","number":60,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C03-R-T59","question":"小安为什么可以直接去找老师？","options":{"A":"老师要借耳机","B":"他还没到学校","C":"同学已经借到耳机"},"answer":"C"}]},"writing":{"examples":{"pinyinCharacter":{"prompt":"请把你的东西（　）在这儿。","pinyin":"fàng","answer":"放"},"pictureSentence":{"word":"看书","image":"assets/images/w-example.jpg","answer":"小男孩正在看书。"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-61","number":61,"lesson":5,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"同学写给我的那封（　），我今天才收到。","pinyin":"xìn","answer":"信","reference":"同学写给我的那封信，我今天才收到。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-62","number":62,"lesson":5,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"这个假期我们打算去南方爬（　）。","pinyin":"shān","answer":"山","reference":"这个假期我们打算去南方爬山。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-63","number":63,"lesson":5,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"太（　）快要出来了，外面亮起来了。","pinyin":"yáng","answer":"阳","reference":"太阳快要出来了，外面亮起来了。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-64","number":64,"lesson":6,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"进门以前必（　）先让老师看一看你的卡。","pinyin":"xū","answer":"须","reference":"进门以前必须先让老师看一看你的卡。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-65","number":65,"lesson":6,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"两件衣服都挺合适，我还没（　）好。","pinyin":"xuǎn","answer":"选","reference":"两件衣服都挺合适，我还没选好。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-66","number":66,"lesson":6,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"耳机","image":"assets/images/c03-w-66.jpg","reference":"她戴着耳机在电脑前听音乐。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-67","number":67,"lesson":6,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"红绿灯","image":"assets/images/c03-w-67.jpg","reference":"红绿灯还没变，他在路口等。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-68","number":68,"lesson":5,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"锻炼","image":"assets/images/c03-w-68.jpg","reference":"她每天早上都到外面锻炼。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-69","number":69,"lesson":5,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"拍照","image":"assets/images/c03-w-69.jpg","reference":"她正在用手机给两个孩子拍照。"},{"id":"HSK3-C03-W-70","number":70,"lesson":6,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"充电","image":"assets/images/c03-w-70.jpg","reference":"他正在给手机充电。"}]},"title":"第3次课 · 照片和出行","writingRubric":{"2":